WEBVTT

00:04:28.264 --> 00:04:30.308
to focus on your own work.

00:04:30.516 --> 00:04:33.019
If you have a project
that going to take you 10 hours

00:04:33.019 --> 00:04:34.687
of really focused time and effort,

00:04:34.687 --> 00:04:36.480
schedule that time in your calendar.

00:04:36.647 --> 00:04:39.150
Try putting in “no-fly zones”
two hours a day,

00:04:39.150 --> 00:04:40.276
a few days a week,

00:04:40.276 --> 00:04:43.154
at whatever time
you’re at your most productive.

00:04:44.071 --> 00:04:46.657
You don’t have to make
these changes in a vacuum,

00:04:46.657 --> 00:04:48.159
like it’s some kind of secret.

00:04:48.492 --> 00:04:50.953
You can tell people
that you’re trying something new

00:04:50.953 --> 00:04:52.705
and taking control of your calendar.

00:04:52.747 --> 00:04:55.124
And you do not have to do
everything at once.

00:04:55.291 --> 00:04:57.793
Simply pick one idea and try it.

00:04:58.210 --> 00:05:00.212
People will not only understand it,